# Settings ▸ Appearance ▸ Sidebar ▸ "Animate sidebar docking" (11 Nov 2026, off by default). Off, ⌘S
# slides the sidebar away and back on Arc's near-instant slide; switched on from the settings page,
# both ways glide and the card eases into its inset frame (CraCore SidebarMotion.docking).
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
wait 2
cra://action/toggleSidebar
expect-log sidebar slides away over 0.085 s
wait 1
cra://action/toggleSidebar
expect-log sidebar slides docked over 0.085 s
wait 1
cra://action/settings
wait 3
cra://debug?settingsPane=appearance
wait 1.5
expect-log settings tab shown \(appearance, existing\)
cra://debug?settingsPageJS=document.body.innerText.includes('Animate sidebar docking')
expect-log settings page js: (1|true)
cra://debug?settingsPageJS=craSettings.set('animateSidebarDocking',true).then(s=>`dock ${s.settings.animateSidebarDocking}`)
expect-log settings page js: dock (1|true)
cra://action/toggleSidebar
expect-log sidebar slides away over 0.42 s
expect-log sidebar glides, the page resizing with its card
wait 1
cra://action/toggleSidebar
expect-log sidebar slides docked over 0.42 s
wait 1
